# Cache expiry on the engine clock: an entry lives while `now < deadline`
# ([NSTG.2.4.2]).
#
# Pump 1  `rw` writes "k" with a 10_s TTL.
# Pump 2  `r1` reads at the write's instant: a hit.
# Pump 3  one nanosecond before the deadline: still a hit.
# Pump 4  exactly at the deadline: a miss; the pump-entry sweep removes it
#         before `r3` reads.
assert Trig tag=w
pump
assert Trig tag=r1
pump
advance 9999999999
assert Trig tag=r2
pump
advance 1
assert Trig tag=r3
pump
